      "en": "The Jews answered him, “We have a law, and by our law he ought to die, because he made himself the Son of God.”",
      "ko": "유대인들이 대답하되 우리에게 법이 있으니 그 법대로 하면 저가 당연히 죽을 것은 저가 자기를 하나님 아들이라 함이니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "575aa68c8680a7fb6c7a7e4174772a24d67186d762110f839a97a2490f8b4aac",
      "translation_text_hash": "7db098359777bd85e3c4062285960ce4ef9b45852a284bd6c1e6d69a0b9d185c",
