      "en": "Jesus answered, “You would have no power at all against me, unless it were given to you from above. Therefore he who delivered me to you has greater sin.”",
      "ko": "예수께서 대답하시되 위에서 주지 아니하셨더면 나를 해할 권세가 없었으리니 그러므로 나를 네게 넘겨 준 자의 죄는 더 크니라 하시니",
      "source_text_hash": "fa1269cad9b018a35116949695190e5b23043efa89416fb9305e913afd385e08",
      "translation_text_hash": "c8b1f92e7156d3d7f1c449013d9abf4a11f42a6fe400a24ed131c89d8bda070b",
