      "en": "Now it was the Preparation Day of the Passover, at about the sixth hour. He said to the Jews, “Behold, your King!”",
      "ko": "이 날은 유월절의 예비일이요 때는 제 육시라 빌라도가 유대인들에게 이르되 보라 너희 왕이로다",
      "source_text_hash": "a10b1aa4af35175347263b912026eec1bf4e52acc4f0ee208defa01bb8cb3194",
      "translation_text_hash": "bb9ef01de428d277eb6a1c6452b6891b22ed2678a3e3e310a5f543d222b3c15e",
