        {
          "book": "JHN",
          "chapter": 19,
          "verse": 26
        }
      ],
      "en": "Therefore when Jesus saw his mother, and the disciple whom he loved standing there, he said to his mother, “Woman, behold, your son!”",
      "ko": "예수께서 그 모친과 사랑하시는 제자가 곁에 섰는 것을 보시고 그 모친께 말씀하시되 여자여 보소서 아들이니이다 하시고",
      "source_text_hash": "a97acf69aefd7e42d37660aab1ca1c37de1e07f092b31374725d1548517c70ca",
      "translation_text_hash": "b95306001a6444fd05247bcac72f3c063518c18e1bbec576a57d78da781b2541",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
